"""Launcher; the implementation lives in tools/nonos_linux_pack/.

`nonos-linux-pack --sysroot ... --program ...` packs a Linux program's closure
into the store (tools/nonos_linux_pack/__init__.py says how).
`nonos-linux-pack syscalls --from-log LOG...` prints a program's measured
syscall set as policies.txt's `calls=` (tools/nonos_linux_pack/syscalls.py).
"""

